# CHEAT CLIP — Environment Template
# ============================================================
# This app does NOT use a server-side Gemini API key.
# Users provide their own Gemini API key via the web interface at runtime.
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# ============================================================

# --- Supadata API keys (YouTube metadata/transcripts on cloud IPs) ---
# Comma-separated; the backend rotates through them on rate limits/quota.
# Free tier: 100 req/month per key -> get a few and list them all.
#   - REQUIRED on Vercel/serverless: YouTube blocks datacenter IPs, so direct
#     scraping fails there and Supadata is the only transcript source.
#   - Optional locally: local runs fetch transcripts/metadata directly (free).
# Get keys at: https://supadata.ai/
SUPADATA_API_KEYS=

# --- CORS allowed origins (browser origins allowed to call this API) ---
# Comma-separated list. Default (unset): local Vite dev servers only
# (http://localhost:5173). Production is same-origin (Vercel routes /api to
# this backend), so no entry is needed unless another site calls the API.
# "*" = allow any origin (development only — NOT for public deployments).
# Example: ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://cheat-clip.vercel.app,https://clip.example.com
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=

# --- Optional HTTP proxy for yt-dlp scraping (heatmap data) ---
# Needed ONLY if you want the viewer-retention HEATMAP from datacenter IPs
# (Vercel/AWS). Supadata provides title/duration + transcripts but NO heatmap.
# Use a residential/ISP proxy (e.g. Webshare). Leave empty to disable.
# PROXY_URL=http://user:pass@host:port
